"⟪k:0⟫When I was with her, I was in the role of her lover.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She never questioned my love "
"for her,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando eu estava com ela, eu estava no papel de seu amante.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ela nunca questionou "
"meu amor por ela,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4E14A007_20AC_4A61_97F4_1B3027DA0750
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdbbf05422748fd90271ccfc5baa2e75087b15eb592c3df1403a452815ef74d9
