msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EABAD2BF_4D3A_4694_B1C7_4EFD0D32A5E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In time, her generosity turned excessive—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫self-destructive.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She would even "
"skip meals so that others could eat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Com o tempo, sua generosidade se tornou excessiva—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫autodestrutiva.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ela até "
"pulava refeições para que outros pudessem comer."

#: scenario8:scenario8_70982F6D_135F_4C1A_A630_E80E9D30C67C
