#: scenario8:scenario8_7A9315A6_A2DF_4804_8BCB_58932D32646F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fb3dad84847923be2037b0b0b1dc7b44c152271b76ccce3da0c015adb4baa1c
