msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Isn’t it comical, then, that you would choose God’s sacred house to stretch your legs "
"in, you filthy dog?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Não é cômico, então, que você escolha a casa sagrada de Deus para esticar as pernas, "
"seu cão imundo?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4FF8CAF7_22A8_4DA5_BA99_AE5B77AC77FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ed821d46fd26bb61586b00ff2821af333f670f8494fb0992d7c8b17d5b1d651
