"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hah. Os plebeus amam seus heróis e santos.⟪k:2⟫Eles engolem essa porcaria na hora."

#: scenario8:scenario8_302B4B1B_F3A3_4444_9340_CDB1A6C5C7ED
